    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Sokoku</strong> is a block-pushing game with a twist: you not only push blocks, you <i>are</i> one. Specifically, you are a die that rolls over itself, changing its top face with every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/7672df3c17c46a26a464fb57ff531f98.poster.avif?t=1753821276\" width=616 height=211 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/7672df3c17c46a26a464fb57ff531f98.webm?t=1753821276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to plan your path carefully so that all numbers end where they have to, including the one on top of yourself, while you interact with all kinds of cubes and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/bd5b7a8b2104ffb15b7949d4ee917e23.poster.avif?t=1753821276\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/bd5b7a8b2104ffb15b7949d4ee917e23.webm?t=1753821276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/bd5b7a8b2104ffb15b7949d4ee917e23.mp4?t=1753821276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of puzzles will test your logic, patience, and spatial thinking. Can you roll your way to the solution?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Sokoku</strong> is a block-pushing game with a twist: you not only push blocks, you <i>are</i> one. Specifically, you are a die that rolls over itself, changing its top face with every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/7672df3c17c46a26a464fb57ff531f98.poster.avif?t=1753821276\" width=616 height=211 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/7672df3c17c46a26a464fb57ff531f98.webm?t=1753821276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to plan your path carefully so that all numbers end where they have to, including the one on top of yourself, while you interact with all kinds of cubes and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/bd5b7a8b2104ffb15b7949d4ee917e23.poster.avif?t=1753821276\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/bd5b7a8b2104ffb15b7949d4ee917e23.webm?t=1753821276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/bd5b7a8b2104ffb15b7949d4ee917e23.mp4?t=1753821276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of puzzles will test your logic, patience, and spatial thinking. Can you roll your way to the solution?</p>",
    "short_description": "A block-pushing game where you not only push blocks, you are one. Plan your movements so that the right number ends up on top, while you interact with other cubes and mechanics. Can you roll your way to the solution?",
